      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barbican_Estate",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Between 1963 and 1965, the Metropolitan line was rerouted 500 metres to make room for the Barbican Estate.",
